ASRgwas                 ASRgwas: An R package to perform complex
                        Genome-Wide Association Studies (GWAS)
audit.gwas              Checks/audits datasets and matrices prior to
                        GWAS
geno.apricot            Genotypic data for apricot dataset published by
                        Nsibi _et al._ (2020)
gwas.asreml             Fits Genome-wide Association Studies (GWAS)
                        model
manhattan.plot          Draws one or more Manhattan plots for GWAS
                        marker data results
map.apricot             Genomic map for apricot dataset published by
                        Nsibi _et al._ (2020)
map.plot                Draws the genetic map
marker.plot             Generates phenotype-by-genotype plots for
                        selected markers
pheno.apricot           Raw phenotypic information for apricot dataset
                        published by Nsibi _et al._ (2020)
pre.gwas                Prepares and audits phenotypic and genomic data
                        for GWAS
qq.plot                 Draws one or more Q-Q plots for GWAS marker
                        data results
select.marker           Selects final set of GWAS markers using
                        backward elimination
